- [x] Reusable `<SectionCard>` shell — Built `src/components/canvas/SectionCard.tsx` consolidating duplicate outer card styling, top header row, `<ArrowLeft /> Home` navigation, copy-link button, and dynamic `<h1>`/`<h2>` logic, removing ~400 lines of boilerplate across all 10 section components.
- [x] Travel stories deep-linking & router synchronization — Synced `/travel/:storyId` in `InfiniteCanvas.tsx`, `TravelStoriesSection.tsx`, `SEO.tsx`, and `scripts/prerender.js`, enabling direct deep-linking and static pre-rendering for all travel stories.
- [x] Browser history drag pollution fix — Updated `handlePositionChange` in `InfiniteCanvas.tsx` with `{ replace: true }` during mouse/touch panning, preventing intermediate drag coordinates from polluting the browser history back-stack.
- [x] Discrete integer grid navigation — Replaced continuous trigonometry and Euclidean distance formulas (`Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy)`) in `useGridNavigation.ts` with 100% deterministic discrete `(col, row)` integer searches.
- [x] Viewport resize drift fix — Synchronized `viewportPosition` in `InfiniteCanvas.tsx` when responsive spacing updates on window resize or orientation changes while not dragging.
- [x] Prune zombie state & dead tracking code — Removed unused `navigationHistory` state from `useSectionManagement.ts` / `NavigationBreadcrumb.tsx`, and streamlined `useVisitTracking.ts` to a lightweight visit counter.
- [x] Toast system unification — Removed unused `@radix-ui/react-toast` system (`toaster.tsx`, `toast.tsx`, `use-toast.ts`), keeping only `sonner`.
- [x] App root simplification — Removed unused `QueryClientProvider` and `TooltipProvider` from `AppShell.tsx` and `AppRoutes.tsx`.
- [x] Pruned dead files, UI components & 136 npm packages — Deleted unreferenced `src/App.css`, deleted 44 unused starter components in `src/components/ui/`, and uninstalled unused npm packages (`@tanstack/react-query`, `recharts`, `date-fns`, `embla-carousel-react`, `input-otp`, `next-themes`, `react-day-picker`, `react-hook-form`, `react-resizable-panels`, `vaul`, `zod`, unused `@radix-ui/*`).
