- [x] Article Reader Event & Overlay Isolation — Restructured `InfiniteCanvas.tsx` to render `ArticleReaderView` outside the draggable canvas container, added event propagation stops (`onMouseDown`, `onMouseMove`, `onMouseUp`, `onTouch*`, `onPointerDown`), applied `cursor-default`, prevented background keyboard navigation from intercepting arrow keys during reading, and added automated E2E test coverage verifying mouse drag/arrow key isolation.
- [x] Standardized E2E Test Suite & CLI Runner — Consolidated 13+ ad-hoc scratch verification scripts into a first-class, maintainable E2E test harness and runner (`npm run test:e2e` / `npm test` / `node scripts/verify.js`) validating 36 tests across 5 suites: SSG static HTML, canonical section deep-linking from `sections.ts`, 2D discrete grid keyboard navigation, interactive UI/progressive disclosure, and responsive viewports with Firefox via `puppeteer-core` (see `dev/plans/e2e-test-suite.md`).
