### Core Infinite Canvas & Infrastructure
- [x] Infinite canvas 2D spatial grid — hook architecture split (`useViewport`, `useSectionManagement`, `useCanvasEvents`, `useGridNavigation`), `translate3d` hardware acceleration, and mobile touch scroll protection.
- [x] 2D Canvas Grid Redesign & First-Class Home Node — Unified section positioning around discrete integer coordinates `{ col, row }`, integrated Home into `allSections` at `(0, 0)` with `alwaysExpanded: true` (never collapses to mini placeholder), fixed CSS transform override bug in `animate-expand-card` to ensure pixel-perfect vertical & horizontal centering, and tuned responsive spacing (1050px base) so adjacent placeholder previews peek onto desktop viewport edges with zero card overlap.
- [x] Visitor tracking & navigation — `useVisitTracking` local storage analytics, edge boundaries with home return button, and internal canvas target panning.
- [x] Direct URL canvas viewport alignment — Replaced standalone `getInitialPosition` in `InfiniteCanvas.tsx` with dynamic position derivation from `useSectionManagement`'s responsive `allSections` array and synchronized `useEffect`, ensuring direct URL loads (`/projects`, `/travel`, `/ataco`, `/writing`, etc.) are 100% pixel-centered.
- [x] Compact Section Placeholders & Proximity Expansion — Built `SectionPlaceholder` component for inactive grid sections on initial page load, rendering icon, title, subtitle, gradient styling, and an interactive 'Pan or click to expand' target; smoothly animates into full detailed section components via `animate-expand-card` scale/fade CSS keyframes as the viewport approaches (`EXPAND_THRESHOLD <= 850px`) or upon click.
- [x] Deployment & CI — GitHub Pages deployment pipeline (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`), Surge preview command (`make surge`), and resume download link routing.
- [x] Text Selection & Canvas Drag Decoupling — Integrated smart target filtering and active selection cancellation in `useCanvasEvents.ts` (`handleMouseDown` and `handleMouseMove`) alongside `cursor-default` on `SectionCard.tsx` and `HomeSection.tsx`, allowing full native text highlighting and copying on cards without translating the canvas viewport.
- [x] Agent & IDE integration — AGY / Antigravity 2.0 rules, GEMINI.md, and automated browser verification setup (`.gemini/skills/verify/SKILL.md`).

