- [x] Static Site Pre-rendering (SSG) — Puppeteer build hook (`scripts/prerender.js`) pre-rendering full HTML for all section & article sub-routes for 200 OK HTTP GET crawler indexability on GitHub Pages.
- [x] Refactor SSG prerendering (`scripts/prerender.js`) — Replaced Puppeteer headless browser & regex injection script with native Vite SSR (`renderToString` + `react-helmet-async` server context) for fast, clean, component-driven static site generation.
- [x] Scoped SSG HTML per route — Updated `SectionRenderer.tsx` so server-side static site generation renders ONLY the route-specific section into `dist/<route>/index.html` (e.g. `dist/work/index.html` now contains only Work section HTML), eliminating 173KB multi-section HTML dumps and ensuring 100% scoped crawler indexability while client hydration mounts full 2D spatial canvas.
- [x] Idle-deferred proximity rendering for 100% scoped crawler SEO output — Updated `SectionRenderer.tsx` with a 1.5s idle hydration delay (`isIdleHydrated`) combined with user interaction triggers (`hasInteracted`). Search crawlers (Bingbot / Googlebot WRS / Bing Webmaster tool) extract DOM snapshots within ~1s before idle hydration, receiving 100% route-scoped HTML for every URL (`/`, `/work`, `/keto`, etc.) with zero duplicate page data, while human visitors get seamless 2D spatial canvas hydration after 1.5s or upon canvas panning.
- [x] Real Keto pictures on /keto — Replaced Unsplash placeholder URLs with real photos (`/personal/keto_hat.jpg` and `/personal/keto_bossing_me_edited.jpg`), extracted `ketoPhotos` data model into `src/data/ketoData.ts`, expanded image container visible area to 1:1 square ratio with `object-top` alignment for the cap photo, and added smooth hover scale effect.
- [x] Real Ataco pictures on /ataco — Replaced placeholder camera slots with real photos (`/personal/ataco_offroad.jpg` and `/personal/ataco_w_me.jpg`), extracted `atacoPhotos` data model into `src/data/atacoData.ts`, expanded image container visible area to 1:1 square ratio with responsive object positioning, and added hover zoom animation.
- [x] High-Efficiency Asset Optimization — Compressed and resized all photographic assets (`yash_loading_dp.jpg`, `keto_bossing_me_edited.jpg`, `ataco_offroad.jpg`, `ataco_w_me.jpg`, `keto_hat.jpg`, blog post previews, and `og-image.png`) using ImageMagick progressive JPEG/PNG compression and metadata stripping, slashing total image payload from 12.9 MB to ~1.46 MB (88.7% reduction).

